WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.600
Shape your route: cities, dates, day trips and transfers.

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:09.200
Tell us who is traveling. ITBMO adapts the pace and needs of your
route.

00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:15.200
Add your departure if you know it. Or skip this step and continue
with your cities.

00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:22.400
Madrid · May 1–5. Set your arrival, stay length and available start
time.

00:00:22.400 --> 00:00:27.800
Segovia · Day 2. The day trip fits within your stay in Madrid.

00:00:27.800 --> 00:00:32.800
Toledo · Day 4. Let ITBMO organize transport and timing if needed.

00:00:32.800 --> 00:00:39.300
Madrid to Barcelona · 13:00. Add a known transfer or let ITBMO plan
the logistics.

00:00:39.300 --> 00:00:45.500
Barcelona + Montserrat + Girona. These day trips fit within your
days in Barcelona.

00:00:45.500 --> 00:00:51.000
Madrid · Transit only. Use transit when connecting to your return,
without a stay.

00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:57.000
Madrid to San José · 20:00. Add the return details if you already
know them.

00:00:57.000 --> 00:01:04.200
Review your entire route. Three stops, nine effective days and four
day trips.

00:01:04.200 --> 00:01:09.000
Your route is ready to personalize.

